display_name = "Coin-Op"
role = "Arcade token machine pistol: sprays brass tokens full-auto, 12 a second. Free Play: every third kill, and every headshot kill, spits back a bonus token that puts 4 rounds straight back in the magazine, so a streak keeps it firing. Hold the trigger past a second and it tilts: the rate climbs to 15 a second but the spray widens (the red TILT light); let go briefly to straighten it out. Tokens glance off heavies and alphas (85%): pick off the rank and file."
